<title>USA: Plexus sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Plexus sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEENAH, Wis. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plexus Corp said its board declared a two-for-one stock split, effective August 25, record August 14.</p>
<p>The split will increase the number of Plexus common shares outstanding to about 14.6 million, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
